# sabotage=PassesDropCalls: behind the pass a call is gone. The pass answers for what its rules expand, and no rule expands a call of an unknown function into nothing: the build stops
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass Select
# DIAGNOSTIC: VerificationFailedAfterPass 1
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass sabotage=PassesDropCalls
# PROGRAM-OF: passes-drop-calls-left-alone.ir
